ne bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1973 Honda CB 750 K2</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\"><a href=\"/sv/auctions/honda-cb-350-four\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/a827c92713215aae2817909e3a1784a0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1973 Honda CB 350 Four GRM019\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1973 Honda CB 350 Four</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\"><a href=\"/sv/auctions/honda-cb-750-k6\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/18c79a970d0082ba1e73cbccc7f663a5\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1977 Honda CB 750 K6 JPL888\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1977 Honda CB 750 K6</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\"><a href=\"/sv/auctions/honda-cb-750-k2-2\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/c00c79a3b95d79a1a8bb93e03aaff9aa\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1975 Honda CB 750 K2 HXP084\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1975 Honda CB 750 K2</h4></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class